  id: base_dread_terror_cloud
  title: Cloud of terror
  description: This spell paralyzes all heroes in a room or a corridor. A paralyzed
    hero cannot move, attack or defend. They can break free from the spell immediately
    or on their next turn by rolling 1 red die for each of their spirit points. If
    they roll a 6, they are freed.
